answer.worked:
Let the circle's radius be $r$. The square's side is $2r$.
$$\begin{align*}
\text{Fraction shaded} &= \frac{(2r)^2-\pi r^2}{(2r)^2} \\
\text{Fraction shaded} &= \frac{4r^2-\pi r^2}{4r^2} \\
\text{Fraction shaded} &= \frac{4-\pi}{4}
\end{align*}$$
